          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/assault-defense.astro:17pvt3">The “ladder” of Assault charges in Michigan ranges from misdemeanor Simple Assault and/or Assault and Battery, to capital charges, punishable by up to life in prison. &nbsp;These include:</p>
